<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Your Post Has Been Rejected</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #f8d7da; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .content { background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #f5c6cb; border-radius: 5px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: #dc3545; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; }
        .error { color: #721c24; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h2 class="error">❌ Your Post Has Been Rejected</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Hello {{ post.author.email }},</p>

        <p>We’re sorry to inform you that your post "<strong>{{ post.title }}</strong>" has not been approved for publication on our blog.</p>

        {% if reason %}
            <p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{ reason }}</p>
        {% else %}
            <p>No specific reason was provided by the administrator.</p>
        {% endif %}

        <p>You can edit your post and submit it again for review if you wish.</p>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <small>This is an automated message from BlogApp. Please do not reply to this email.</small>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
